Phosphor — a Yapfast theme

The theme itself (theme.json, icon.png, the preview pictures in previews/,
the procedural art in art/, the drawn cursors in cursors/ and the
synthesised sounds in sounds/, all made
for this theme by the scripts in tools/) is dedicated to the public domain
under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The pixel icons in icons/ are adapted from Solar, the icon set by 480 Design
(https://www.figma.com/community/file/1166831539721848736), under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Each stock Yapfast icon (most
taken from Solar's Bold style) was resampled onto a 16 x 16 pixel grid and
redrawn by hand where detail was lost (tools/icons.py, tools/hand.py).
The pixel versions are shared under the same CC BY 4.0 licence.

It ships two font families, each under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). Their full licence texts are in fonts/:

- fonts/TerminusTTF-Regular.ttf, fonts/TerminusTTF-Bold.ttf — Terminus (TTF) 4.49.3
  Copyright (c) 2010 Dimitar Toshkov Zhekov, with Reserved Font Name "Terminus Font";
  Copyright (c) 2011-2023 Tilman Blumenbach, with Reserved Font Name "Terminus (TTF)"
  (https://files.ax86.net/terminus-ttf/). Licence: fonts/OFL-TerminusTTF.txt

- fonts/VT323-Regular.ttf — VT323
  Copyright 2011, The VT323 Project Authors (https://fonts.google.com/specimen/VT323)
  Licence: fonts/OFL-VT323.txt

The fonts are unmodified and are not sold on their own.
